        "name": "Abhik Dey",
        "transcript": "So one of my most interesting machine learning project I am working on right now is detecting products by CCTV footage in a shopping mall and group them under the same level of. Same company levels and for this project I am using. Yellow Object detection Yellow V10 I used. SKU 110 product data set. I train yellow V10 model on that and get my fine-tuned model of yellow for detecting products. Then after detecting all the products in the particular frame of image, I am getting the bounding boxes of around each product and then. They I am. Cropping. Cropping according to those burning boxes around every each and every products in the image image frame. And then I'm using resonate fine-tuned reset which I created a custom data set for products and I use that fine-tuned race net 50 to extracting features from the cropped images. And then I use game in clustering and cosine similarity. Them and created a grouping algorithm manually which will label them assigned to their respective. Company labels of those products and it's still in developing steps. So that's all.",
